Subject: [PATCH v9 06/12] usb: typec: tcpm: Use new Type-C switch/mux and usb-role-switch functions
Date: Tue, 20 Mar 2018 15:57:07 +0300
Message-Id: <20180320125713.85465-7-heikki.krogerus@linux.intel.com>
